## Tokens, 8 parameters (23 October 2026)

`--lg-blur` 22px, `--lg-sat` 170%, `--lg-tint-top` .20, `--lg-tint-bottom` .07, `--lg-rim` .60, `--lg-radius` 26px, `--lg-veil` .34, `--bg-blur` 4px. Derived and never edited: `--lg-fill`, `--lg-filter`, `--lg-edge`, `--lg-shadow`. The panel « Paramètres » writes only these variables and copies them for the prompt. (23 October 2026)

## Rules paid for (23 October 2026)

- The wallpaper lives in `body::before`, a sibling layer: an ancestor with `filter` or `backdrop-filter` would kill every glass below it (SilentBugs1.md). Never nest a `backdrop-filter` inside another one. (23 October 2026)
- Tab and answer are ONE glass element: `.shape` gets `clip-path: path()` computed by `outline()` (top edge continuous, concave fillet at the join), and an SVG `.rim` strokes the same path with a white gradient. Two adjacent glass boxes always show a seam. (23 October 2026)
- The answer panel top equals the selected row top (`row.offsetTop`), recomputed on click, resize (ResizeObserver plus requestAnimationFrame) and fonts loaded. Measured: 0 px gap on all 12 rows and on a 60-row thread. Under 900 px the answer moves right under its question. (23 October 2026)
- French spacing: a thin no-break space before `? ! : ;` so a lone « ? » never wraps. (23 October 2026)
- Weight: 1.33 MB before, 315 KB after (HTML 17 KB, fonts 100 KB, AVIF 197 KB), same render. (23 October 2026)

## Reuse (23 October 2026)

Copy the folder into the atelier, replace `QUESTIONS` (or the list markup) and the wallpaper, then run `node ShootV5.mjs <out-dir>` against a local server on port 4196. (23 October 2026)
